sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Comerciante
  participant Web as Frontend
  participant API as Express API
  participant Econ as economic-index.service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>Web: Abrir desglose IPC / Confirmar
  Web->>API: GET /api/locals/:id/ipc-breakdown
  API-->>Web: IPC por rubro COICOP
  U->>Web: Aplicar IPC al local
  Web->>API: PUT /api/locals/:id/apply-ipc
  API->>Econ: applyIPCToLocal
  Econ->>DB: latest IPC_INDEC por preferred_index
  Note over Econ: Excluye rubros BCRA_USD
  Econ->>DB: update products cost + sale_price
  Econ->>DB: price_history change_reason IPC_INDEC
  Econ->>DB: set last_ipc_applied_period
  DB-->>Econ: ok
  Econ-->>API: summary affected
  API-->>Web: success
  Web-->>U: Banner IPC aplicado
